U7DWbs8AAAAC-WvPaA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwroy/agent-sts2/labels/type:infra","name":"type:infra","color":"0075ca","default":false,"description":"tooling, ops, workflow","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12774527217,"node_id":"LA_kwDOU7DWbs8AAAAC-WvQ8Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwroy/agent-sts2/labels/status:waiting-release","name":"status:waiting-release","color":"5319e7","default":false,"description":"accepted, waiting for live publication at a run boundary","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12774527499,"node_id":"LA_kwDOU7DWbs8AAAAC-WvSCw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwroy/agent-sts2/labels/area:learning","name":"area:learning","color":"bfd4f2","default":false,"description":"learning loop and refresh","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-10-24T13:20:36Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T16:10:22Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"[Claude] 发布等待期间放行“只产候选”的学习：拆出发布专用的开局准入，不再用全局 LLM_DRAIN\n\n## 背景\n\n代码发布要等当前对局自然结束，ops 现在用全局 `LLM_DRAIN` 实现这段等待。调度的 `paused()` 把它和 PAUSE 同等对待，learn tick 整段停掉。10-24 两次发布各停了约 1 小时外部学习：13:46–14:40 是 #55，19:21–20:19 是 #37/#20。#56 四道上线后损失会翻倍。\n\nops 已分析（#51 评论，20:25 回执）：自然等待阶段只需挡住下一局。冻结输入、独立 worktree/scratch、merge=no 的候选计算不需要停。\n\n## 要做\n\n1. **发布专用开局准入**：新增发布对局准入标记，带 owner、PID-birth、范围、阶段。发布事务的自然等待改用它。开局侧同步接入以下三处：\n   - `ops/autoplay.sh`\n   - `ops/run.sh`\n   - `ops/codex-ops-actions.sh`\n2. **保留全局门原语义**：PAUSE、账号切换/ACCOUNT_DRAIN、旧的或未知的全局 LLM_DRAIN 都照旧挡。若改用统一的带类型 marker，须同步修改：\n   - `ops/codex-ops.sh:46/231`\n   - `ops/codex-ops-learn.py:396/669`\n   - finish 后续派发、直接 dispatch/write\n\n   不能只删 `paused()`。\n3. **候选模式放行**：候选模式在启动绑定里显式固定，沿用原有磁盘、用量、槽位、沙箱门。\n   - 实际写入和源快照走统一锁序：短 learn.lock，加原有刷新/发布锁串行。\n   - 禁止持发布锁再等 learn 锁，也禁止持锁等整局。\n   - `open_book_refresh` 是写忽略层的独立阶段，不跟着豁免。\n\n## 验收\n\n- [ ] 固定数据测试逐项覆盖：\n  - 发布等待期间能派候选，但不能开局；\n  - 账号切换、PAUSE、未知旧门仍挡；\n  - finish 的记账与后续派发分开；\n  - 资源门有效；\n  - 候选不写 live；\n  - 源快照一致；\n  - 写入竞争；\n  - 拥有者崩溃、替换、释放。\n- [ ] 上线后第一次自然边界发布读回：等待期间外部学习继续派发并完成，对局在发布完成前不开新局。\n\n## 边界\n\n- 不改沙箱权限，不强制 tick。\n- 与 #56 分开评审；#56 当前范围不变。\n\nowner:dev，P1，area:learning。上线交集成员和 ops。\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwroy/agent-sts2/issues/57/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwroy/agent-sts2/issues/57/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}